{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他觉得这份喜欢值得留着，不舍得收淡，于是越来越常惦念对方，喜欢渐渐不是想收就能收住的。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得收淡\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"眼前的亲近明明还好，他却不能决定它能留多久，已经有点怕它留不住。\",\n      \"key\": \"怕它留不住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是想把喜欢留在心里，不想让盼着回应的心思牵着自己走。\",\n      \"key\": \"留在心里\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他越来越盼对方能懂自己的关心，可还是觉得不该催对方，只好自己消化这份期待。\",\n      \"key\": \"自己消化\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R28\", \"R30\", \"R32\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把喜欢变重、频繁惦念和舍不得收淡合并，落到他越来越常想起对方、越来越难收住心意。S06-3中留在心里的甜意改写了先前的轻松，S06-2中真实发生过的关切也说明他为何舍不得收淡。R30中盼对方理解的一面保留在S07-4。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"修正跨段箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"删除S06-4到S07-2的箭头，因为它只重复害怕亲近留不住。改由S03-3提供理由：他早已发现自己无法决定对方是否珍惜自己，因此也无法决定眼前的亲近能持续多久。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R29\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"修正跨段箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"保留想把喜欢留在心里、不让期待牵着自己走的意思。删除S06-1到S07-3的箭头，改由S06-3解释他为何仍想把喜欢留在心里；S06-2则说明把心思放回当下、不让回应欲牵着自己走的做法仍在起作用。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R30\", \"R31\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留盼对方理解自己的关心、仍不愿催促对方、只能自己消化期待这三层相连的意思，避免重复解释克制的理由。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bc25a0fc-e1c7-4b77-b948-e5fdafa0e88e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T224508431987Z", "elapsed_seconds": 173.0, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:48:01.452056+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "aff4fd1c0bcea347ca682c4e22d819862e81a988d942f2350b12cb9e50109298", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T224508431987Z", "files": 